@startuml sequence-enrichment
title Completing / Overwriting Metadata and Covers via Open APIs (persisted to files)

actor User
participant "React SPA" as SPA
participant "tracks / library route" as Route
participant "enrichmentService" as Enrich
participant "metadataLookupService" as Lookup
participant "iTunes Search API" as ITunes
participant "Deezer API" as Deezer
participant "MusicBrainz /\nCover Art Archive" as MB
participant "artworkService" as Art
participant "tagWriterService" as TagWriter
database "SQLite" as DB
collections "Audio files\n/data/music" as Files

User -> SPA : ••• -> Complete metadata / Overwrite metadata /\nDownload cover (or album buttons)
SPA -> Route : POST /api/tracks/:id/enrich | /overwrite | /cover\nPOST /api/library/albums/enrich | /overwrite | /cover
Route -> Enrich : enrichTrack / enrichAlbum /\noverwriteTrack / overwriteAlbum /\ndownloadTrackCover / downloadAlbumCover
Enrich -> Lookup : track or album lookup
note right of Lookup : provider = auto | itunes |\ndeezer | musicbrainz\n(from UI choicebox)
loop selected provider(s), up to 5 candidates each
  Lookup -> ITunes : GET /search
  ITunes --> Lookup : candidates
  Lookup -> Deezer : GET /search/track | /search/album
  Deezer --> Lookup : candidates
  Lookup -> MB : GET /ws/2/recording | /release
  MB --> Lookup : candidates (cover via CAA)
end
Lookup -> Lookup : score candidates vs existing tags\n(title/artist/duration/album, threshold 0.45)
Lookup --> Enrich : best match or null
Enrich -> DB : UPDATE tracks\n(enrich: fill MISSING fields only,\noverwrite: replace album/albumArtist/genre/year/trackNo,\nnever title/artist)
Enrich -> TagWriter : writeTags(file, merged metadata)
TagWriter -> Files : save ID3/Vorbis/MP4 tags
opt cover needed (enrich: only if none, cover download: replace, overwrite: never)
  Enrich -> Art : fetchArtwork(url)
  Art --> Enrich : image bytes
  Enrich -> Art : storeArtwork -> covers/<sha1>
  Enrich -> TagWriter : writeCover(file, image)
  TagWriter -> Files : embed front cover
  Enrich -> DB : UPDATE tracks.artwork_file
end
Enrich --> Route : result + source
Route --> SPA : JSON
SPA -> User : "... saved into the file(s)"
@enduml
